"The Order of the Night King is a secret mage society serving a leader it calls 'our lord'."
"Its aim is to end merit rule and restore a monarchy of noble blood."
"It corrupts monsters, land and sea on purpose, to harvest blightstones."
"Its great aim is blight dungeons: dungeons that spawn corrupted monsters without end."
"Its top members are called the Nine; all of them were set to hunt Renir."
"Its ranks run from the Nine down to cowardly messengers such as Jergil."
"An Inner Circle of its mages each laid a ward on the gem that holds Renir."
"Renir found it corrupting monsters; it caught him drunk and sealed him in an amber gem."
"Renir's self-wards stop them killing him, so they drain his power through the gem."
"The gem has nine seals; two are broken and seven remain."
"A Night Order agent called the White Mage senses when a seal of the gem breaks."
"Since the second seal broke, Renir cannot hide in an Inventory, so he can be tracked."
"Lucien, Merlin's eldest son and heir to Mystic Prism, is a Night Order leader."
"Lucien was once Renir's disciple on the Path of Lost Magic, and now hates him."
"Lucien is white-haired and suave; he reads minds, flies, teleports and kills his own men."
"Lucien knows souls from Earth are reborn here, and covets their knowledge."
"Renir suspects a fellow Pillar betrayed him; Merlin is likely complicit."
"Forty years ago Order mages tainted the Divine Necklace of Sunpeak on Blightpeak."
"Order mages came to Sunvale every few months, took food and climbed Blightpeak."
"Walter, Beatrice and Arvid, Order mages, fled Sunvale after a magpie routed them."
"The Order made an island off Abylport a blight dungeon, cored by a Divine bracelet."
"That dungeon was meant to swallow Abylport; Liora purified its core and foiled it."
"Xernon, Franceska and Leonard, Order mages on that island, were killed there."
"A lab on a small tropical island near the merfolk city cast corrupting slabs into the sea."
"That lab kept a pool of living black ichor; Cee and Renir sank the island."
"Lucien was last seen fighting corrupted beasts in the sinking lab; he likely lives."
"The Order keeps a hideout in a stone maze under a criminal pub in Coralia's back alleys."
"Order agents raided and burned Renir's pocket-dimension villa near Coralia."
"Forestwind Mage Academy force-infuses students with mana and is likely an Order tool."
"A distant relative of Merlin's family recruits Forestwind's students."
"The Order bribed two holy mages away from Sallie's secret clinic with better pay."
"The Order makes constructs, such as the Ambush Dreadspider in Coralia's jungle."
"The Order offered Liora treasure and evolution resources to join it; she refused."
